# ORIGAMI Python / data conventions

- Prefer extending `MechanismProfile` over ad-hoc ODE branches in UI code
- Load kinetic priors from `models/kinetic_models/*.defaults.json` via `src/core/asset_paths.py`
- Label synthetic fixtures `data_class: synthetic_fixture` — never as Tier-1 experimental
- Predictions must include uncertainty and evidence maturity
- New parts: allowlist ID + provenance first; checksummed sequence only when deposited
- Keep dual ODE trees (`ode_model/*.py` vs `ode_model/mechanisms/`) consistent or route through `solver.py` only
- After numeric/biology edits, run relevant pytest modules (or full `pytest`)
